    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Built on a custom speech-recognition game engine, Sibylline mixes elements of cinema, literature and audience participation into a hallucinatory and terrifying experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0MICROPHONE REQUIRED!\u00a0 MOUSE AND KEYBOARD ARE NOT USED DURING GAMEPLAY. YOU CAN ONLY ADVANCE BY READING AND PERFORMING THE STORY ALOUD.\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 You wake up alone in a strange room\u00a0with a machine\u00a0that is programmed to kill you in the next hour.\u00a0 Can you find a way to stop the execution schedule?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURING:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique voice-acting game mechanic.\u00a0 You perform the dialogue!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A custom live-action game engine focused on synesthetic storytelling and\u00a0audience role play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original handcrafted story interwoven with real historical figures and events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal imagery and hallucinogenic cinematography, all filmed and crafted by human hands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warnings:\u00a0 Features bright colors, flashing images, blood.\u00a0 Some players of Sibylline\u00a0have reported strange sensations\u00a0after interacting with it.\u00a0 If you\u00a0experience any symptoms, such as auditory hallucinations or a vague sense that someone else is controlling your hands,\u00a0 stop playing immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Built on a custom speech-recognition game engine, Sibylline mixes elements of cinema, literature and audience participation into a hallucinatory and terrifying experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0MICROPHONE REQUIRED!\u00a0 MOUSE AND KEYBOARD ARE NOT USED DURING GAMEPLAY. YOU CAN ONLY ADVANCE BY READING AND PERFORMING THE STORY ALOUD.\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 You wake up alone in a strange room\u00a0with a machine\u00a0that is programmed to kill you in the next hour.\u00a0 Can you find a way to stop the execution schedule?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURING:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique voice-acting game mechanic.\u00a0 You perform the dialogue!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A custom live-action game engine focused on synesthetic storytelling and\u00a0audience role play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original handcrafted story interwoven with real historical figures and events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal imagery and hallucinogenic cinematography, all filmed and crafted by human hands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warnings:\u00a0 Features bright colors, flashing images, blood.\u00a0 Some players of Sibylline\u00a0have reported strange sensations\u00a0after interacting with it.\u00a0 If you\u00a0experience any symptoms, such as auditory hallucinations or a vague sense that someone else is controlling your hands,\u00a0 stop playing immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0A hallucinogenic speech-controlled cinematic horror story. Microphone required. Unlike anything you've ever played.",
